+# Independent actual-emulator QA harness
+
+Test-only instrumentation for the native personal-card/verified-retry/blacklist increment.
+Nothing from `app/src/androidTest` is included in the production application. The application
+installed for acceptance must be the separately built exact final production APK, **not** an
+APK assembled in this test-dependency-modified worktree.
+
+## Safety and provenance
+
+* Dedicated disposable AOSP API26 emulator; no connected user device, no real credentials.
+* Production MainActivity tests use the unmodified application and real Android storage/picker.
+  Guest public GETs are authorized and may fail normally; this is NOT an offline-boot claim.
+  Do not use adb root or change any host/user/emulator network security policy. Only local test-owned blacklist ID
+  `42424242` may be written/exported by the actual SAF exercise.
+* Authenticated tests instantiate production `NativeApp`, transport, decoder, account runtime
+  with memory-only fake credentials and local state. Network interceptors either return exact
+  allowlisted local fixtures or throw before any `chain.proceed`; images are local PNG assets.
+* The only allowed synthetic POST is the production graphic-verification request with precisely
+  `type=err_request_captcha`, `code=AB12`; it never reaches a service. Tests type into the actual
+  graphic UI. This is not real CAPTCHA/provider acceptance and does not bypass security.
+* Blacklist boundary tests use a synthetic ActivityResultRegistry/document adapter and are
+  labelled as such. They establish category freeze, duplicate/cancel behavior and JSON validation,
+  **not** Android SAF provider integration. Production launch tests separately open actual SAF.
+* Images are untouched compositor screenshots (`UiAutomation.takeScreenshot`) from Android,
+  not Compose render/Canvas/Robolectric output. Original PNGs are collected with request logs.
+
+## Preparation and execution
+
+1. Rebase/cherry-pick to final accepted production code, keeping test files/dependencies isolated.
+2. Verify `git diff FINAL_COMMIT -- app/src/main` is empty (also compare production buildSrc and
+   root build configuration). Record final commit/tree/source fingerprint and final APK SHA256.
+3. Acquire shared `heavy-gates.lock`, source task-local toolchain, build
+   `:app:assembleDebugAndroidTest` with max-workers1/in-process Kotlin. Release lock afterward.
+4. Start the sole emulator through `native-toolchain/open-emulator.sh` in a persistent shell with
+   the ordinary unprivileged helper mode, exact final production APK path, evidence directory. Keep all subsequent
+   adb in that same shell. Helper retains heavy lock until stopped.
+5. Install test APK, verify package path→pull→cmp of production APK, record both APK hashes.
+6. Run `adb -s emulator-5580 shell am instrument -w -r
+   io.github.ktclat.c001apk.nativeapp.test/androidx.test.runner.AndroidJUnitRunner`.
+7. Pull `/sdcard/Android/data/io.github.ktclat.c001apk.nativeapp/files/independent-emulator-qa`.
+   Save instrumentation log, logcat/crash buffer, Android build/display/network policy and
+   test manifest. Record guest network observations separately from fixture requests. Use wm size640x1200/320dpi for dedicated narrow dark/large-font methods; reset.
+8. Independently inspect original PNGs. Failures are not passes; fix/rebuild/re-run final source.
+   Stop the sole emulator using the stop helper after collecting all evidence.
+
+## Explicitly outside acceptance
+
+No live authenticated Coolapk reads, social writes, actual account login, CAPTCHA provider SDK, device performance,
+physical device, TalkBack, persistent user-account migration or complete Flutter parity claim.
+Personal route Back refetches first page; only blacklist child Back is tested for scroll/draft
+retention. Rich cards restore already-decoded source fields; no new linked `data.feed` model.
